  "behaviour": "It is omnivorous, feeding on fruits, insects, small birds, rodents, small reptiles and centipedes. Usually they live in pairs and sometimes roost in flocks of hundreds of individuals. They breed in spring (September and October; at least in part of its range) and lay clutches of one to three white eggs, incubated for 40 days.",
